      "side": 1,
      "message": "The patch description doesn\u0027t look correct to me. There can\u0027t be a race condition since the slave_alloc and slave_configure callback invocations are serialized. Can the issue that has been observed by modifying the code that is invoked by the callback function invoked by the tracepoint?",
