      "writtenOn": "2023-05-11T03:31:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t racing issue, but it will call trace_android_vh_ufs_update_sdev(sdev) twice in ufs init flow. So we want to remove redundant function call.",
